  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "半導體製程、元件模型與電路設計概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO SEMICONDUCTOR DEVICES, PROCESSES AND CIRCUIT DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "半導體產業包含半導體晶圓廠、積體電路設計與封裝測試。本課程先介紹主要半導體製程與理想半導體元件模型，進一步介紹利用元件模型與布局規範進行積體電路模擬設計流程，最後介紹積體電路的封裝與測試。",
    "describe_eh": "The semiconductor industry includes semiconductor fabs, integrated circuit design, packaging and testing. This course first introduces the main semiconductor manufacturing processes and ideal semiconductor device models, then further introduces the IC simulation design flow using component models and layout rules, and finally introduces the packaging and testing of integrated circuits.",
    "pre_subname": "",
